      "parameters": {
        "content": "## KK - New Order Processing\nReceives each order from the Kiln & Kapas store, checks it,\nsaves it to Google Sheets (KK-Orders-2026) and sends emails.\n\nGood order  → Orders tab + email to Hana + email to customer\nBad order   → Errors tab + alert to Hana\nDuplicate   → Errors tab + alert to Hana (not saved again)",
