      "name": "Sticky Note"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 1. Receive and clean\nThe store sends the order here (POST /kk-new-order).\nClean Order Data fixes spaces, capitals, the date\n(always YYYY-MM-DD, Malaysia time), the total and the address.\nTo change a rule, edit the field in Clean Order Data.",
        "height": 192,
        "width": 496,
        "color": 4
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -512,
        -256
      ],
      "id": "a69c7461-8cb9-4b61-a278-9fc9ec150fc0",
      "name": "Sticky Note1"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 2. Check the order\nEvery field must be filled in, the email must be valid,\nquantity must be a whole number (1 or more), total above 0.\nIf not → logged in Errors as \"Validation\", Hana is alerted,\nthe store gets 422.",
        "height": 224,
        "width": 352,
        "color": 4
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        64,
